  "details": "This have happened in other worlds for me as well. But can only think of Super VR Ball at the moment. \nThe main menu starts to follow your face and you can't get rid of it. The lock only stops it from moving up and down. Grabbing it really doesn't do anything useful either.\nClosing and opening again does not help. Rejoining the instance or changing world helps. \nhttps://youtu.be/JoTc5JepQJU\n^Video showing problem\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a7b9ed95-6b96-4a67-9d91-68235cdc5644\n^The world we were in, at least one other person had the bug there.",
